{"bookId":"zephaniah","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The word of the LORD which came unto Zephaniah the son of Cushi, the son of Gedaliah, the son of Amariah, the son of Hizkiah, in the days of Josiah the son of Amon, king of Judah.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"which came unto"},{"text":"Zephaniah","strongs":["H6846"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Cushi","strongs":["H3570"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Gedaliah","strongs":["H1436"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Amariah","strongs":["H0568"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Hizkiah","strongs":["H2396"]},{"text":", in the"},{"text":"days","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Josiah","strongs":["H2977"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Amon","strongs":["H0526"]},{"text":","},{"text":"king","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"I will utterly consume all things from off the land, saith the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"I will"},{"text":"utterly","strongs":["H0622"]},{"text":"consume","strongs":["H5486"]},{"text":"all things from off the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"I will consume man and beast; I will consume the fowls of the heaven, and the fishes of the sea, and the stumblingblocks with the wicked; and I will cut off man from off the land, saith the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"I will"},{"text":"consume","strongs":["H5486"]},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"beast","strongs":["H0929"]},{"text":"; I will"},{"text":"consume","strongs":["H5486"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"fowls","strongs":["H5775"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"heaven","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"fishes","strongs":["H1709"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"stumblingblocks","strongs":["H4384"]},{"text":"with the"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H7563"]},{"text":"; and I will cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0127"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"I will also stretch out mine hand upon Judah, and upon all the inhabitants of Jerusalem; and I will cut off the remnant of Baal from this place, and the name of the Chemarims with the priests;","tokens":[{"text":"I will also stretch"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H5186"]},{"text":"mine"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"upon"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":", and upon all the"},{"text":"inhabitants","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jerusalem","strongs":["H3389"]},{"text":"; and I will cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"remnant","strongs":["H7605"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Baal","strongs":["H1168"]},{"text":"from this"},{"text":"place","strongs":["H4725"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"Chemarims","strongs":["H3649"]},{"text":"with the"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":5,"text":"And them that worship the host of heaven upon the housetops; and them that worship and that swear by the LORD, and that swear by Malcham;","tokens":[{"text":"And them that"},{"text":"worship","strongs":["H7812"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"host","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"heaven","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":"upon the"},{"text":"housetops","strongs":["H1406"]},{"text":"; and them that"},{"text":"worship","strongs":["H7812"]},{"text":"and that"},{"text":"swear","strongs":["H7650"]},{"text":"by the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and that"},{"text":"swear","strongs":["H7650"]},{"text":"by"},{"text":"Malcham","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":6,"text":"And them that are turned back from the LORD; and those that have not sought the LORD, nor enquired for him.","tokens":[{"text":"And them that are turned"},{"text":"back","strongs":["H5472"]},{"text":"from","strongs":["H0310"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"; and those that have not"},{"text":"sought","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", nor"},{"text":"enquired","strongs":["H1875"]},{"text":"for him."}]},{"number":7,"text":"Hold thy peace at the presence of the Lord GOD: for the day of the LORD is at hand: for the LORD hath prepared a sacrifice, he hath bid his guests.","tokens":[{"text":"Hold thy"},{"text":"peace","strongs":["H2013"]},{"text":"at the"},{"text":"presence","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"Lord","strongs":["H0136"]},{"text":"GOD","strongs":["H3069"]},{"text":": for the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is at"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H7138"]},{"text":": for the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath"},{"text":"prepared","strongs":["H3559"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"sacrifice","strongs":["H2077"]},{"text":", he hath"},{"text":"bid","strongs":["H6942"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"guests","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"And it shall come to pass in the day of the LORD’s sacrifice, that I will punish the princes, and the king’s children, and all such as are clothed with strange apparel.","tokens":[{"text":"And it shall come to pass in the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"sacrifice","strongs":["H2077"]},{"text":", that I will"},{"text":"punish","strongs":["H6485"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"princes","strongs":["H8269"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"king’s","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":"children","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":", and all such as are"},{"text":"clothed","strongs":["H3847"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"strange","strongs":["H5237"]},{"text":"apparel","strongs":["H4403"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"In the same day also will I punish all those that leap on the threshold, which fill their masters’ houses with violence and deceit.","tokens":[{"text":"In the same"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"also will I"},{"text":"punish","strongs":["H6485"]},{"text":"all those that"},{"text":"leap","strongs":["H1801"]},{"text":"on the"},{"text":"threshold","strongs":["H4670"]},{"text":", which"},{"text":"fill","strongs":["H4390"]},{"text":"their"},{"text":"masters’","strongs":["H0113"]},{"text":"houses","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"deceit","strongs":["H4820"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"And it shall come to pass in that day, saith the LORD, that there shall be the noise of a cry from the fish gate, and an howling from the second, and a great crashing from the hills.","tokens":[{"text":"And it shall come to pass in that"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", that there shall be the"},{"text":"noise","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of a"},{"text":"cry","strongs":["H6818"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"fish","strongs":["H1709"]},{"text":"gate","strongs":["H8179"]},{"text":", and an"},{"text":"howling","strongs":["H3215"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"second","strongs":["H4932"]},{"text":", and a"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"crashing","strongs":["H7667"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"hills","strongs":["H1389"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"Howl, ye inhabitants of Maktesh, for all the merchant people are cut down; all they that bear silver are cut off.","tokens":[{"text":"Howl","strongs":["H3213"]},{"text":", ye"},{"text":"inhabitants","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Maktesh","strongs":["H4389"]},{"text":", for all the"},{"text":"merchant","strongs":["H3667"]},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"are cut"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H1820"]},{"text":"; all they that"},{"text":"bear","strongs":["H5187"]},{"text":"silver","strongs":["H3701"]},{"text":"are cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"And it shall come to pass at that time, that I will search Jerusalem with candles, and punish the men that are settled on their lees: that say in their heart, The LORD will not do good, neither will he do evil.","tokens":[{"text":"And it shall come to pass at that"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":", that I will"},{"text":"search","strongs":["H2664"]},{"text":"Jerusalem","strongs":["H3389"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"candles","strongs":["H5216"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"punish","strongs":["H6485"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"that are"},{"text":"settled","strongs":["H7087"]},{"text":"on their"},{"text":"lees","strongs":["H8105"]},{"text":": that"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"in their"},{"text":"heart","strongs":["H3824"]},{"text":", The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"will not do"},{"text":"good","strongs":["H3190"]},{"text":", neither will he do"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7489"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Therefore their goods shall become a booty, and their houses a desolation: they shall also build houses, but not inhabit them; and they shall plant vineyards, but not drink the wine thereof.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore their"},{"text":"goods","strongs":["H2428"]},{"text":"shall become a"},{"text":"booty","strongs":["H4933"]},{"text":", and their"},{"text":"houses","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H8077"]},{"text":": they shall also"},{"text":"build","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":"houses","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":", but not"},{"text":"inhabit","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"them; and they shall"},{"text":"plant","strongs":["H5193"]},{"text":"vineyards","strongs":["H3754"]},{"text":", but not"},{"text":"drink","strongs":["H8354"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"wine","strongs":["H3196"]},{"text":"thereof."}]},{"number":14,"text":"The great day of the LORD is near, it is near, and hasteth greatly, even the voice of the day of the LORD: the mighty man shall cry there bitterly.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"near","strongs":["H7138"]},{"text":", it is"},{"text":"near","strongs":["H7138"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"hasteth","strongs":["H4118"]},{"text":"greatly","strongs":["H3966"]},{"text":", even the"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":": the mighty"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H1368"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"cry","strongs":["H6873"]},{"text":"there"},{"text":"bitterly","strongs":["H4751"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"That day is a day of wrath, a day of trouble and distress, a day of wasteness and desolation, a day of darkness and gloominess, a day of clouds and thick darkness,","tokens":[{"text":"That"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"is a"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"wrath","strongs":["H5678"]},{"text":", a"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"trouble","strongs":["H6869"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"distress","strongs":["H4691"]},{"text":", a"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"wasteness","strongs":["H7722"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H4875"]},{"text":", a"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"darkness","strongs":["H2822"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"gloominess","strongs":["H0653"]},{"text":", a"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"clouds","strongs":["H6051"]},{"text":"and thick"},{"text":"darkness","strongs":["H6205"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":16,"text":"A day of the trumpet and alarm against the fenced cities, and against the high towers.","tokens":[{"text":"A"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"trumpet","strongs":["H7782"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"alarm","strongs":["H8643"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"fenced","strongs":["H1219"]},{"text":"cities","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":", and against the"},{"text":"high","strongs":["H1364"]},{"text":"towers","strongs":["H6438"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"And I will bring distress upon men, that they shall walk like blind men, because they have sinned against the LORD: and their blood shall be poured out as dust, and their flesh as the dung.","tokens":[{"text":"And I will bring"},{"text":"distress","strongs":["H6887"]},{"text":"upon"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":", that they shall"},{"text":"walk","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":"like blind"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H5787"]},{"text":", because they have"},{"text":"sinned","strongs":["H2398"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":": and their"},{"text":"blood","strongs":["H1818"]},{"text":"shall be poured"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H8210"]},{"text":"as"},{"text":"dust","strongs":["H6083"]},{"text":", and their"},{"text":"flesh","strongs":["H3894"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"dung","strongs":["H1561"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":18,"text":"Neither their silver nor their gold shall be able to deliver them in the day of the LORD’s wrath; but the whole land shall be devoured by the fire of his jealousy: for he shall make even a speedy riddance of all them that dwell in the land.","tokens":[{"text":"Neither their"},{"text":"silver","strongs":["H3701"]},{"text":"nor their"},{"text":"gold","strongs":["H2091"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"able","strongs":["H3201"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"deliver","strongs":["H5337"]},{"text":"them in the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"wrath","strongs":["H5678"]},{"text":"; but the whole"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"devoured","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"by the"},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"jealousy","strongs":["H7068"]},{"text":": for he shall"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"even a"},{"text":"speedy","strongs":["H0926"]},{"text":"riddance","strongs":["H3617"]},{"text":"of all them that"},{"text":"dwell","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"2":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Gather yourselves together, yea, gather together, O nation not desired;","tokens":[{"text":"Gather yourselves"},{"text":"together","strongs":["H7197"]},{"text":", yea, gather"},{"text":"together","strongs":["H7197"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"nation","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"not"},{"text":"desired","strongs":["H3700"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":2,"text":"Before the decree bring forth, before the day pass as the chaff, before the fierce anger of the LORD come upon you, before the day of the LORD’s anger come upon you.","tokens":[{"text":"Before the"},{"text":"decree","strongs":["H2706"]},{"text":"bring"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H3205"]},{"text":", before the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"pass","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"chaff","strongs":["H4671"]},{"text":","},{"text":"before","strongs":["H3808"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"fierce","strongs":["H2740"]},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"upon you, before the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"upon you."}]},{"number":3,"text":"Seek ye the LORD, all ye meek of the earth, which have wrought his judgment; seek righteousness, seek meekness: it may be ye shall be hid in the day of the LORD’s anger.","tokens":[{"text":"Seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"ye the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", all ye"},{"text":"meek","strongs":["H6035"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", which have"},{"text":"wrought","strongs":["H6466"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"righteousness","strongs":["H6664"]},{"text":","},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"meekness","strongs":["H6038"]},{"text":": it may"},{"text":"be","strongs":["H0194"]},{"text":"ye shall be"},{"text":"hid","strongs":["H5641"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"For Gaza shall be forsaken, and Ashkelon a desolation: they shall drive out Ashdod at the noon day, and Ekron shall be rooted up.","tokens":[{"text":"For"},{"text":"Gaza","strongs":["H5804"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"forsaken","strongs":["H5800"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"Ashkelon","strongs":["H0831"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H8077"]},{"text":": they shall drive"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H1644"]},{"text":"Ashdod","strongs":["H0795"]},{"text":"at the noon"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H6672"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"Ekron","strongs":["H6138"]},{"text":"shall be rooted"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6131"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Woe unto the inhabitants of the sea coast, the nation of the Cherethites! the word of the LORD is against you; O Canaan, the land of the Philistines, I will even destroy thee, that there shall be no inhabitant.","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"inhabitants","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"coast","strongs":["H2256"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"nation","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"Cherethites","strongs":["H3774"]},{"text":"! the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is against you; O"},{"text":"Canaan","strongs":["H3667"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"Philistines","strongs":["H6430"]},{"text":", I will even"},{"text":"destroy","strongs":["H0006"]},{"text":"thee, that there shall be no"},{"text":"inhabitant","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"And the sea coast shall be dwellings and cottages for shepherds, and folds for flocks.","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"coast","strongs":["H2256"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"dwellings","strongs":["H5116"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"cottages","strongs":["H3741"]},{"text":"for"},{"text":"shepherds","strongs":["H7462"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"folds","strongs":["H1448"]},{"text":"for"},{"text":"flocks","strongs":["H6629"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"And the coast shall be for the remnant of the house of Judah; they shall feed thereupon: in the houses of Ashkelon shall they lie down in the evening: for the LORD their God shall visit them, and turn away their captivity.","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"coast","strongs":["H2256"]},{"text":"shall be for the"},{"text":"remnant","strongs":["H7611"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":"; they shall"},{"text":"feed","strongs":["H7462"]},{"text":"thereupon: in the"},{"text":"houses","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Ashkelon","strongs":["H0831"]},{"text":"shall they lie"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H7257"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"evening","strongs":["H6153"]},{"text":": for the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"their"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"visit","strongs":["H6485"]},{"text":"them, and turn"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"their"},{"text":"captivity","strongs":["H7622"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"I have heard the reproach of Moab, and the revilings of the children of Ammon, whereby they have reproached my people, and magnified themselves against their border.","tokens":[{"text":"I have"},{"text":"heard","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"reproach","strongs":["H2781"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Moab","strongs":["H4124"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"revilings","strongs":["H1421"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"children","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Ammon","strongs":["H5983"]},{"text":", whereby they have"},{"text":"reproached","strongs":["H2778"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"magnified","strongs":["H1431"]},{"text":"themselves against their"},{"text":"border","strongs":["H1366"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Therefore as I live, saith the LORD of hosts, the God of Israel, Surely Moab shall be as Sodom, and the children of Ammon as Gomorrah, even the breeding of nettles, and saltpits, and a perpetual desolation: the residue of my people shall spoil them, and the remnant of my people shall possess them.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore as I"},{"text":"live","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":", Surely"},{"text":"Moab","strongs":["H4124"]},{"text":"shall be as"},{"text":"Sodom","strongs":["H5467"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"children","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Ammon","strongs":["H5983"]},{"text":"as"},{"text":"Gomorrah","strongs":["H6017"]},{"text":", even the"},{"text":"breeding","strongs":["H4476"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"nettles","strongs":["H2738"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"saltpits","strongs":["H4379"]},{"text":", and a"},{"text":"perpetual","strongs":["H5704"]},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H8077"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"residue","strongs":["H7611"]},{"text":"of my"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"spoil","strongs":["H0962"]},{"text":"them, and the"},{"text":"remnant","strongs":["H3499"]},{"text":"of my"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"possess","strongs":["H5157"]},{"text":"them."}]},{"number":10,"text":"This shall they have for their pride, because they have reproached and magnified themselves against the people of the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"This shall they have for their"},{"text":"pride","strongs":["H1347"]},{"text":", because they have"},{"text":"reproached","strongs":["H2778"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"magnified","strongs":["H1431"]},{"text":"themselves against the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"The LORD will be terrible unto them: for he will famish all the gods of the earth; and men shall worship him, every one from his place, even all the isles of the heathen.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"will be"},{"text":"terrible","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"unto them: for he will"},{"text":"famish","strongs":["H7329"]},{"text":"all the"},{"text":"gods","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"; and men shall"},{"text":"worship","strongs":["H7812"]},{"text":"him, every"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"from his"},{"text":"place","strongs":["H4725"]},{"text":", even all the"},{"text":"isles","strongs":["H0339"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"heathen","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"Ye Ethiopians also, ye shall be slain by my sword.","tokens":[{"text":"Ye"},{"text":"Ethiopians","strongs":["H3569"]},{"text":"also,"},{"text":"ye","strongs":["H1992"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"slain","strongs":["H2491"]},{"text":"by my"},{"text":"sword","strongs":["H2719"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"And he will stretch out his hand against the north, and destroy Assyria; and will make Nineveh a desolation, and dry like a wilderness.","tokens":[{"text":"And he will stretch"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H5186"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"north","strongs":["H6828"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"destroy","strongs":["H0006"]},{"text":"Assyria","strongs":["H0804"]},{"text":"; and will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H8077"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"dry","strongs":["H6723"]},{"text":"like a"},{"text":"wilderness","strongs":["H4057"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"And flocks shall lie down in the midst of her, all the beasts of the nations: both the cormorant and the bittern shall lodge in the upper lintels of it; their voice shall sing in the windows; desolation shall be in the thresholds: for he shall uncover the cedar work.","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"flocks","strongs":["H5739"]},{"text":"shall lie"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H7257"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H8432"]},{"text":"of her, all the"},{"text":"beasts","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":": both the"},{"text":"cormorant","strongs":["H6893"]},{"text":"and the"},{"text":"bittern","strongs":["H7090"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"lodge","strongs":["H3885"]},{"text":"in the upper"},{"text":"lintels","strongs":["H3730"]},{"text":"of it; their"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"sing","strongs":["H7891"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"windows","strongs":["H2474"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H2721"]},{"text":"shall be in the"},{"text":"thresholds","strongs":["H5592"]},{"text":": for he shall"},{"text":"uncover","strongs":["H6168"]},{"text":"the cedar"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H0731"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"This is the rejoicing city that dwelt carelessly, that said in her heart, I am, and there is none beside me: how is she become a desolation, a place for beasts to lie down in! every one that passeth by her shall hiss, and wag his hand.","tokens":[{"text":"This is the"},{"text":"rejoicing","strongs":["H5947"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"dwelt","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"carelessly","strongs":["H0983"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"in her"},{"text":"heart","strongs":["H3824"]},{"text":", I am, and there is none"},{"text":"beside","strongs":["H0657"]},{"text":"me: how is she become a"},{"text":"desolation","strongs":["H8047"]},{"text":", a place for"},{"text":"beasts","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":"to lie down"},{"text":"in","strongs":["H4769"]},{"text":"! every one that passeth"},{"text":"by","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"her shall"},{"text":"hiss","strongs":["H8319"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"wag","strongs":["H5128"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"3":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Woe to her that is filthy and polluted, to the oppressing city!","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"to her that is"},{"text":"filthy","strongs":["H4754"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"polluted","strongs":["H1351"]},{"text":", to the"},{"text":"oppressing","strongs":["H3238"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"!"}]},{"number":2,"text":"She obeyed not the voice; she received not correction; she trusted not in the LORD; she drew not near to her God.","tokens":[{"text":"She"},{"text":"obeyed","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"not the"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"; she"},{"text":"received","strongs":["H3947"]},{"text":"not"},{"text":"correction","strongs":["H4148"]},{"text":"; she"},{"text":"trusted","strongs":["H0982"]},{"text":"not in the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"; she drew not"},{"text":"near","strongs":["H7126"]},{"text":"to her"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"Her princes within her are roaring lions; her judges are evening wolves; they gnaw not the bones till the morrow.","tokens":[{"text":"Her"},{"text":"princes","strongs":["H8269"]},{"text":"within","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"her are"},{"text":"roaring","strongs":["H7580"]},{"text":"lions","strongs":["H0738"]},{"text":"; her"},{"text":"judges","strongs":["H8199"]},{"text":"are"},{"text":"evening","strongs":["H6153"]},{"text":"wolves","strongs":["H2061"]},{"text":"; they gnaw not the"},{"text":"bones","strongs":["H1633"]},{"text":"till the"},{"text":"morrow","strongs":["H1242"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Her prophets are light and treacherous persons: her priests have polluted the sanctuary, they have done violence to the law.","tokens":[{"text":"Her"},{"text":"prophets","strongs":["H5030"]},{"text":"are"},{"text":"light","strongs":["H6348"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"treacherous","strongs":["H0900"]},{"text":"persons","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":": her"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":"have"},{"text":"polluted","strongs":["H2490"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"sanctuary","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":", they have done"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2554"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"The just LORD is in the midst thereof; he will not do iniquity: every morning doth he bring his judgment to light, he faileth not; but the unjust knoweth no shame.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"just","strongs":["H6662"]},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"thereof; he will not"},{"text":"do","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H5766"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"every","strongs":["H1242"]},{"text":"morning","strongs":["H1242"]},{"text":"doth he"},{"text":"bring","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"light","strongs":["H0216"]},{"text":", he"},{"text":"faileth","strongs":["H5737"]},{"text":"not; but the"},{"text":"unjust","strongs":["H5767"]},{"text":"knoweth","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"no"},{"text":"shame","strongs":["H1322"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"I have cut off the nations: their towers are desolate; I made their streets waste, that none passeth by: their cities are destroyed, so that there is no man, that there is none inhabitant.","tokens":[{"text":"I have cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":": their"},{"text":"towers","strongs":["H6438"]},{"text":"are"},{"text":"desolate","strongs":["H8074"]},{"text":"; I made their"},{"text":"streets","strongs":["H2351"]},{"text":"waste","strongs":["H2717"]},{"text":", that none passeth"},{"text":"by","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":": their"},{"text":"cities","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"are"},{"text":"destroyed","strongs":["H6658"]},{"text":", so that there is no"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":", that there is none"},{"text":"inhabitant","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"I said, Surely thou wilt fear me, thou wilt receive instruction; so their dwelling should not be cut off, howsoever I punished them: but they rose early, and corrupted all their doings.","tokens":[{"text":"I"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Surely thou wilt"},{"text":"fear","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"me, thou wilt"},{"text":"receive","strongs":["H3947"]},{"text":"instruction","strongs":["H4148"]},{"text":"; so their"},{"text":"dwelling","strongs":["H4583"]},{"text":"should not be cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":","},{"text":"howsoever","strongs":["H0834"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"punished","strongs":["H6485"]},{"text":"them:"},{"text":"but","strongs":["H0403"]},{"text":"they rose"},{"text":"early","strongs":["H7925"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"corrupted","strongs":["H7843"]},{"text":"all their"},{"text":"doings","strongs":["H5949"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"Therefore wait ye upon me, saith the LORD, until the day that I rise up to the prey: for my determination is to gather the nations, that I may assemble the kingdoms, to pour upon them mine indignation, even all my fierce anger: for all the earth shall be devoured with the fire of my jealousy.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore"},{"text":"wait","strongs":["H2442"]},{"text":"ye upon me,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", until the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"that I rise"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"prey","strongs":["H5706"]},{"text":": for my"},{"text":"determination","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"is to"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H0622"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":", that I may"},{"text":"assemble","strongs":["H6908"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"kingdoms","strongs":["H4467"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"pour","strongs":["H8210"]},{"text":"upon them mine"},{"text":"indignation","strongs":["H2195"]},{"text":", even all my"},{"text":"fierce","strongs":["H2740"]},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":": for all the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"devoured","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"with the"},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":"of my"},{"text":"jealousy","strongs":["H7068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"For then will I turn to the people a pure language, that they may all call upon the name of the LORD, to serve him with one consent.","tokens":[{"text":"For then will I"},{"text":"turn","strongs":["H2015"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"pure","strongs":["H1305"]},{"text":"language","strongs":["H8193"]},{"text":", that they may all"},{"text":"call","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"upon the"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"serve","strongs":["H5647"]},{"text":"him with"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"consent","strongs":["H7926"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"From beyond the rivers of Ethiopia my suppliants, even the daughter of my dispersed, shall bring mine offering.","tokens":[{"text":"From"},{"text":"beyond","strongs":["H5676"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Ethiopia","strongs":["H3568"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"suppliants","strongs":["H6282"]},{"text":", even the"},{"text":"daughter","strongs":["H1323"]},{"text":"of my"},{"text":"dispersed","strongs":["H6327"]},{"text":", shall"},{"text":"bring","strongs":["H2986"]},{"text":"mine"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"In that day shalt thou not be ashamed for all thy doings, wherein thou hast transgressed against me: for then I will take away out of the midst of thee them that rejoice in thy pride, and thou shalt no more be haughty because of my holy mountain.","tokens":[{"text":"In that"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"shalt thou not be"},{"text":"ashamed","strongs":["H0954"]},{"text":"for all thy"},{"text":"doings","strongs":["H5949"]},{"text":", wherein thou hast"},{"text":"transgressed","strongs":["H6586"]},{"text":"against me: for then I will take"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5493"]},{"text":"out of the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of thee them that"},{"text":"rejoice","strongs":["H5947"]},{"text":"in thy"},{"text":"pride","strongs":["H1346"]},{"text":", and thou shalt no"},{"text":"more","strongs":["H3254"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"haughty","strongs":["H1361"]},{"text":"because of my"},{"text":"holy","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":"mountain","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"I will also leave in the midst of thee an afflicted and poor people, and they shall trust in the name of the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"I will also"},{"text":"leave","strongs":["H7604"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of thee an"},{"text":"afflicted","strongs":["H6041"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"poor","strongs":["H1800"]},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":", and they shall"},{"text":"trust","strongs":["H2620"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"The remnant of Israel shall not do iniquity, nor speak lies; neither shall a deceitful tongue be found in their mouth: for they shall feed and lie down, and none shall make them afraid.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"remnant","strongs":["H7611"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":"shall not"},{"text":"do","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H5766"]},{"text":", nor"},{"text":"speak","strongs":["H1696"]},{"text":"lies","strongs":["H3577"]},{"text":"; neither shall a"},{"text":"deceitful","strongs":["H8649"]},{"text":"tongue","strongs":["H3956"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"found","strongs":["H4672"]},{"text":"in their"},{"text":"mouth","strongs":["H6310"]},{"text":": for they shall"},{"text":"feed","strongs":["H7462"]},{"text":"and lie"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H7257"]},{"text":", and none shall make them"},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H2729"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"Sing, O daughter of Zion; shout, O Israel; be glad and rejoice with all the heart, O daughter of Jerusalem.","tokens":[{"text":"Sing","strongs":["H7442"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"daughter","strongs":["H1323"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Zion","strongs":["H6726"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"shout","strongs":["H7321"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":"; be"},{"text":"glad","strongs":["H8055"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"rejoice","strongs":["H5937"]},{"text":"with all the"},{"text":"heart","strongs":["H3820"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"daughter","strongs":["H1323"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jerusalem","strongs":["H3389"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"The LORD hath taken away thy judgments, he hath cast out thine enemy: the king of Israel, even the LORD, is in the midst of thee: thou shalt not see evil any more.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath taken"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5493"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"judgments","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":", he hath cast"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H6437"]},{"text":"thine"},{"text":"enemy","strongs":["H0341"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"king","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":", even the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", is in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of thee: thou shalt not"},{"text":"see","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"any more."}]},{"number":16,"text":"In that day it shall be said to Jerusalem, Fear thou not: and to Zion, Let not thine hands be slack.","tokens":[{"text":"In that"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"it shall be"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Jerusalem","strongs":["H3389"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Fear","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"thou not: and to"},{"text":"Zion","strongs":["H6726"]},{"text":", Let not thine"},{"text":"hands","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"slack","strongs":["H7503"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"The LORD thy God in the midst of thee is mighty; he will save, he will rejoice over thee with joy; he will rest in his love, he will joy over thee with singing.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of thee is"},{"text":"mighty","strongs":["H1368"]},{"text":"; he will"},{"text":"save","strongs":["H3467"]},{"text":", he will"},{"text":"rejoice","strongs":["H7797"]},{"text":"over thee with"},{"text":"joy","strongs":["H8057"]},{"text":"; he will"},{"text":"rest","strongs":["H2790"]},{"text":"in his"},{"text":"love","strongs":["H0160"]},{"text":", he will"},{"text":"joy","strongs":["H1523"]},{"text":"over thee with"},{"text":"singing","strongs":["H7440"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":18,"text":"I will gather them that are sorrowful for the solemn assembly, who are of thee, to whom the reproach of it was a burden.","tokens":[{"text":"I will"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H0622"]},{"text":"them that are"},{"text":"sorrowful","strongs":["H3013"]},{"text":"for the solemn"},{"text":"assembly","strongs":["H4150"]},{"text":", who are of thee, to whom the"},{"text":"reproach","strongs":["H2781"]},{"text":"of it was a"},{"text":"burden","strongs":["H4864"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":19,"text":"Behold, at that time I will undo all that afflict thee: and I will save her that halteth, and gather her that was driven out; and I will get them praise and fame in every land where they have been put to shame.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, at that"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":"I will"},{"text":"undo","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"all that"},{"text":"afflict","strongs":["H6031"]},{"text":"thee: and I will"},{"text":"save","strongs":["H3467"]},{"text":"her that"},{"text":"halteth","strongs":["H6760"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H6908"]},{"text":"her that was driven"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H5080"]},{"text":"; and I will"},{"text":"get","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"them"},{"text":"praise","strongs":["H8416"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"fame","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"in every"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"where they have been put to"},{"text":"shame","strongs":["H1322"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":20,"text":"At that time will I bring you again, even in the time that I gather you: for I will make you a name and a praise among all people of the earth, when I turn back your captivity before your eyes, saith the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"At that"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":"will I"},{"text":"bring","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"you again, even in the"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6256"]},{"text":"that I"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H6908"]},{"text":"you: for I will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"you a"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"and a"},{"text":"praise","strongs":["H8416"]},{"text":"among all"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", when I turn"},{"text":"back","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"your"},{"text":"captivity","strongs":["H7622"]},{"text":"before your"},{"text":"eyes","strongs":["H5869"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]}]}}}